BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 610.2994488188976447 Td
(Karthik testified with immunity and a new lawyer who had never lost a man who could pay.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
68.031496062992133 594.42543307086612 Td
(Vaidyanathan testified from a hospital bed via video, charming, poisonous, admitting nothing that) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
68.031496062992133 578.5514173228345953 Td
(could not be unsaid.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 555.5907874015748575 Td
(Ganesh testified last. They tried to remove him on procedure. Maya’s article—printed on) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
68.031496062992133 539.7167716535433328 Td
(wedding-card stock from a secret press run—named the clerks who had delayed his transfer.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 516.756141732283595 Td
(Anika watched the minister’s eyes when her father’s name was spoken. Not guilt. Fear of a dead) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
68.031496062992133 500.8821259842520703 Td
(man’s handwriting.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 477.9214960629922189 Td
(In the corridor, a boy from St. Jude’s Evening School handed her a chalk drawing of a fish.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 454.9608661417323674 Td
(“Master said you’d come back,” he said. “He left this before he got sick.”) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 432.0002362204725728 Td
(On the back, in her father’s script: If they offer you money, take the truth instead.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 409.0396062992127213 Td
(She wept in a stairwell where no camera went.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 386.0789763779529267 Td
(The commission’s report, nine months later, was seventy pages of careful cowardice. It named) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
68.031496062992133 370.204960629921402 Td
(procedures, not souls. It recommended digitisation. It did not recommend prison for ministers.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 347.2443307086616073 Td
(But the Night Ledger—both books, entered into evidence—sat in a vault with a barcode. And every) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
68.031496062992133 331.3703149606301395 Td
(barcode, Anika knew, could be copied.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 308.409685039370288 Td
(Ganesh made inspector. He did not celebrate.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 285.4490551181104365 Td
(Maya won an award and lost three advertisers.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 262.4884251968505851 Td
(Amma planted jasmine outside the flat and stopped flinching at knocks.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 239.5277952755908473 Td
(Anika went back to the basement on Anna Salai, not at night but in a January morning with) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
68.031496062992133 223.6537795275593226 Td
(permission and a team. The photocopy room was smaller than memory. The water cooler was gone.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
68.031496062992133 207.7797637795277979 Td
(In the wall behind it, bricked up, they found a cavity with one page only—page zero, her father) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
68.031496062992133 191.9057480314963868 Td
(called it in a note.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 168.9451181102365354 Td
(The page listed not names but dates. Forty-one dates. The last date was blank.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 145.9844881889766839 Td
(Anika filled it with today’s pencil and left it for whoever came next.) Tj
