BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
68.031496062992133 571.4648031496062686 Td
(alone, but for Karpagam, for her father, for every name that had become a headline before it) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
68.031496062992133 555.5907874015748575 Td
(became a story.) Tj
