BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 532.6301574803150061 Td
(Ganesh stood beside her without his uniform. “Still counting exits?”) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 509.6695275590551546 Td
(“Still counting truths.”) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 486.70889763779536 Td
(“You could leave. Dubai, Singapore, a life without basements.”) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 463.7482677165355085 Td
(“Chennai is my basement.” She smiled. “Besides, someone has to watch the copier logs.”) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 440.7876377952757139 Td
(He laughed. It had taken a year to return.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 417.8270078740158624 Td
