ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
68.031496062992133 401.9529921259843945 Td
(to a serial where problems resolved in twenty-two minutes.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 378.9923622047245431 Td
