ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 294.2364566929136345 Td
(Selvam ran off two hundred copies—not of the name, but of her father’s rule, set in type that would) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
