(outlive them:) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 255.4018110236222583 Td
(Copy with courage. Break the geometry. Trust the fish.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 232.4411811023624068 Td
(They pasted them on college walls, bus stops, the tax building’s notice board before security woke.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 209.480551181102669 Td
(Chennai woke to paper on glass. The city did not change overnight. Cities never do.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 186.5199212598428176 Td
(But somewhere, a man in maintenance khaki read the poster and hesitated before loading toner.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
68.031496062992133 170.6459055118112929 Td
(Somewhere, an archivist on the night shift saw the fish and knew she was not alone.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.102 0.071 0.031 rg
85.0393700787401627 147.6852755905514414 Td
